Protect older compute managers from sound model requests.

This is broken out into a separate patch for now to make it easier
to review if this is itself a complete change. I am open to merging
it back into the sound model change if that is considered
desirable.

I have chosen to do a bit of a cleanup of the lookup of
minimum compute manager versions, I didn't like how we looked up
the minimum version several times for a single parent call for
both create and resize.